# roamwise/evaluation/*.csv was excluded here, and it should not have been.
# Three of those files are read by the running app, not just by the scripts
# that write them: views/system_logs.py imports evaluation/comparative_analysis
# at module level, and that module reads retrieval_gold.csv while it is being
# imported (RECOMMENDED_POIS) -- so in an image without it the System logs
# screen does not render an empty Results tab, it raises FileNotFoundError on
# import. The tab itself then reads comparative_analysis_results.csv and
# toptw_ceiling.csv. The whole directory is 536 KB against the 49 MB of
# catalogue and street networks the image already carries, so excluding it
# bought about 1% of the data payload and cost the operator screen. It ships.
